            "review_title": "Review at Three Trees",
            "review_text": "Hillary W\nMinneapolis, Minnesota5 contributions\n0\nBeautiful atmosphere\nMar 2018 • Friends\nThe roof top was gorgeous. The staff friendly and helpful. Mixed drinks were fantastic, especially mocktail strawberry mojitos. The steak was a little tough, but the risotto was perfect. Our group enjoyed the Parmesan fries and sharing the homemade BBQ sauce from one friends’ BBQ ribs. There were some items on the menu they were out of, so I think they are still working out some kinks since it is a newer restaurant. But it’s worth checking out because of the location and atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten March 2, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
