            "review_title": "Review at Three Trees",
            "review_text": "Tiên Phạm\nHanoi, Vietnam30 contributions\n0\nNice Place in Sai Gon\nJan 2018 • Business\nI was here with my fellow colleagues on a business trip. We spent our lunch here after some morning drinks. Tbh, the drinks are not so excellent but the food did save our souls. \nWe tried the signature dishes, something of fine dining style that I am usually not so into. Despite that I really enjoy the green-rice dish (cant remember the dish name is why I am not into fine dining :P) with salmon and asparagus and their special sauce. The a-bit-sour sauce brought the rice and the salmon together, make the texture unexpectedly tasty.\nMy friend tried the dish with steak and shrimp, some weird combination to me. Still, the steak was finely cooked and got a praise from my friend.\nHighly recommended for sure!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 1, 2018",
